0:{"buildId":"7afh9cBoHBO9HIwX4Lcyt","data":[{"rsc":["$","$1","c",{"children":[["$","$L2",null,{"toc":[{"depth":2,"url":"#how-this-section-works","title":"How this section works"},{"depth":2,"url":"#pick-your-task","title":"Pick your task"}],"children":[["$","$L3",null,{"children":"How-to guides"}],["$","$L4",null,{"children":"Pick the task you're doing, not the artifact you're reading about."}],["$","$L5",null,{"children":["\n",["$","p",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Who this is for:"}]," anyone with a running Forge who now needs it to do\none specific thing differently. ",["$","strong",null,{"children":"What you'll have at the end:"}]," the one page\nthat does your task, rather than a tour. ",["$","strong",null,{"children":"Time:"}]," as long as the task takes."]}],"\n",["$","div",null,{"data-prerequisites":true,"className":"my-6 rounded-xl border border-border bg-surface-elevated px-5 py-3","children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"my-0 font-mono text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.12em] text-brand","children":"Before you start"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"mt-1 text-sm text-muted-foreground [&>p]:my-0","children":["$","p",null,{"children":["A config file you wrote and understand. See ",["$","$L6",null,{"href":"/configuration","children":"Configuration"}],"."]}]}]]}],"\n",["$","$L7",null,{"as":"h2","id":"how-this-section-works","children":"How this section works"}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"children":["Every page here is a task, phrased as the thing you are trying to do. None of\nthem is a tour of a subsystem (that's what\n",["$","$L6",null,{"href":"/explanations/architecture","children":"Concepts"}]," is for), and none of them is an exhaustive\nfield list, which is what ",["$","$L6",null,{"href":"/reference/glossary","children":"Reference"}]," is for. A recipe gives you\nthe complete working artifact first, then explains only the parts of it you\nhave to decide about, then tells you how to tell it worked."]}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"children":["Pages assume you have read ",["$","$L6",null,{"href":"/configuration","children":"Configuration"}],": you have a config\nfile and you know which part of it you're editing. If you don't yet, that\nsection is worth the detour."]}],"\n",["$","$L7",null,{"as":"h2","id":"pick-your-task","children":"Pick your task"}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"I need my cache stored somewhere else."}],"\n",["$","$L6",null,{"href":"/how-to/stores","children":"Storage backends"}]," compares every place Forge can put\nbytes (",["$","$L6",null,{"href":"/how-to/stores/filesystem","children":"filesystem"}],",\n",["$","$L6",null,{"href":"/how-to/stores/s3-and-compatible","children":"S3 and compatibles"}],",\n",["$","$L6",null,{"href":"/how-to/stores/gcs","children":"GCS"}],", ",["$","$L6",null,{"href":"/how-to/stores/azure","children":"Azure Blob"}],",\n",["$","$L6",null,{"href":"/how-to/stores/oci-object-storage","children":"OCI"}],", ",["$","$L6",null,{"href":"/how-to/stores/redis","children":"Redis"}]," and\n",["$","$L6",null,{"href":"/how-to/stores/mongo","children":"Mongo"}],") on durability, latency and cost.\n",["$","$L6",null,{"href":"/how-to/stores/compose-stores","children":"Compose stores"}]," is how you layer a fast tier\nover a durable one."]}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"I need to shrink what I store or send."}]," See\n",["$","$L6",null,{"href":"/how-to/stores/compression","children":"Remote cache compression"}]," and\n",["$","$L6",null,{"href":"/how-to/stores/chunking-and-dedup","children":"Content-defined chunking"}],"."]}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"I need more than one worker."}],"\n",["$","$L6",null,{"href":"/how-to/run-multiple-workers","children":"Run multiple workers"}]," is the multi-worker\ntopology: how workers share the CAS, how the scheduler picks one, and which\nparts of the shipped example will mislead you."]}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"I need this to be secure on the network."}],"\n",["$","$L6",null,{"href":"/how-to/tls-and-auth","children":"TLS and authentication"}]," covers TLS on the public\nlisteners, mutual TLS as the access control, keeping the worker API off the\npublic interface, and what Forge does not authenticate."]}],"\n","$L8","\n","$L9","\n","$La","\n","$Lb"]}],"$Lc"]}],["$Ld","$Le"],"$Lf"]}],"isPartial":"$@10","staleTime":"$11","varyParams":null},{"rsc":"$L12","isPartial":"$@13","staleTime":"$11","varyParams":null},{"rsc":"$L14","isPartial":"$@15","staleTime":"$11","varyParams":"$16"}],"isUpgradeableISRFallback":false,"a":"$@17","rootVaryParams":null,"needsRuntimeRequest":"$@18"}
